WEBVTT

00:18.160 --> 00:22.240
THE RULES OF PANTANA WITTAYA SCHOOL

00:22.320 --> 00:23.800
It is said

00:23.880 --> 00:26.040
-that there's a rule for everything.
-GENERAL REGULATIONS

00:27.840 --> 00:31.880
And every rule is there for a reason.

00:32.680 --> 00:34.360
A CHAPTER ON DISCIPLINE

00:34.440 --> 00:36.480
But the rule makers always bend the rules.

00:36.560 --> 00:37.720
HEADMASTER,
HEAD OF STUDENT WELFARE,

00:37.800 --> 00:38.880
HOMEROOM AND CLASS TEACHERS,
DEPARTMENT STAFF

00:42.760 --> 00:45.880
So the rules become oppressive

00:45.960 --> 00:47.520
to all of us.

00:47.600 --> 00:48.960
CHAPTER THREE
AUTHORITY OVER PUNISHMENT

00:50.160 --> 00:52.000
And they keep us all tied down.

00:55.000 --> 00:57.320
DETENTION, CONFINEMENT, IMPRISONMENT

00:57.880 --> 00:59.440
It's time for that to change.

03:06.640 --> 03:09.040
Hello. My name is Nanno.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.560
It's nice to meet you.

03:12.480 --> 03:13.920
Go sit over there, Nanno.

03:25.960 --> 03:27.880
Hi, I'm Nanno. What's your name?

03:30.800 --> 03:32.560
Pay attention, Nanno.

03:32.640 --> 03:34.880
You're already behind
the rest of the class.

03:38.040 --> 03:42.160
Okay, turn to chapter four, page 128.

03:46.280 --> 03:48.320
Hi, Nanno. My name is Mie.

03:59.720 --> 04:00.920
What's going on?

04:02.920 --> 04:04.680
Nothing, ma'am. I dropped my pen.

04:05.240 --> 04:09.680
You need to be careful, Mie. You don't
want to be distracting your classmates.

04:10.240 --> 04:11.880
Yeah, I'm sorry.

04:15.400 --> 04:16.480
Here, Nanno.

04:25.640 --> 04:28.760
We are here to do a random bag search.

04:28.840 --> 04:29.800
Yes, ma'am.

04:38.480 --> 04:43.760
This outdated protocol of yours
is a violation of our student's privacy.

04:54.520 --> 04:56.160
This is the best method.

04:57.360 --> 04:59.760
And you don't have
any choice in the matter, understood?

05:01.680 --> 05:03.200
According to the school rules

05:03.280 --> 05:07.080
every single student must always do
as their teacher say.

05:07.160 --> 05:10.120
I'll be the one to decide

05:10.920 --> 05:12.240
if it is unfair.

05:22.280 --> 05:24.080
Now, have I made myself clear to you?

05:26.320 --> 05:27.280
Yeah.

05:32.240 --> 05:33.640
Thank you, Teacher B.

05:33.720 --> 05:35.160
You're most welcome.

05:52.720 --> 05:54.720
The French Revolution took place

05:54.800 --> 05:56.720
in the 1700s.

05:58.400 --> 06:00.520
-The era was considered…
-Nanno.

06:00.600 --> 06:03.880
…a time of change. The financial crisis

06:03.960 --> 06:05.560
-left the royal treasury empty.
-Nanno!

06:21.400 --> 06:22.920
Hello, my dear students,

06:23.720 --> 06:26.440
our highly prestigious
Pantana Wittaya School

06:26.520 --> 06:28.400
has managed to become

06:28.480 --> 06:30.720
a pillar of society,

06:30.800 --> 06:32.480
due to our ethics,

06:32.560 --> 06:35.720
morals and guidance, so please

06:35.800 --> 06:38.120
if you stay disciplined,

06:38.200 --> 06:40.520
you will absolutely achieve everything

06:40.600 --> 06:42.520
you have ever hoped for.

06:51.760 --> 06:53.320
Why do teachers think

06:54.360 --> 06:56.640
they can do whatever they want.

06:56.720 --> 07:00.920
Hm… the teachers here are worse
than you can imagine.

07:01.000 --> 07:04.320
Seriously, Nanno,
you should really be careful.

07:04.400 --> 07:07.760
The teachers at this school despise
people like you.

07:08.320 --> 07:09.520
People like me?

07:09.600 --> 07:13.920
Yeah. You're the type who asks
a lot of questions. They really hate that.

07:17.480 --> 07:19.000
It's not funny, Nanno.

07:21.960 --> 07:25.400
You saw that there are two
empty desks in class?

07:25.480 --> 07:26.720
Wanna know why?

07:28.360 --> 07:29.760
Are they sick?

07:29.840 --> 07:32.080
They belong to New and Jelly.

07:32.160 --> 07:36.760
The other day, Jelly called out
Teacher B for something.

07:36.840 --> 07:40.920
And Teacher B got so upset,
she threw an eraser at her head.

07:46.080 --> 07:48.120
Sorry, it must've slipped.

07:50.520 --> 07:53.600
Don't just sit there.
Someone take her to the nurse's office.

07:57.280 --> 08:00.400
New took a video of what happened
with his phone.

08:01.640 --> 08:03.520
But, Teacher B caught him.

08:05.360 --> 08:07.200
Do you know what happened to them?

08:09.880 --> 08:11.760
The student welfare officer

08:11.840 --> 08:14.320
locked both of them up
in the Repentance Room.

08:14.400 --> 08:17.840
And they haven't come out
of that room since.

08:17.920 --> 08:19.200
No one's heard from them.

08:19.280 --> 08:20.560
Hmm.

08:21.320 --> 08:22.880
Sounds kind of fun.

08:24.640 --> 08:27.720
Let's go find it. Wanna come with me?

08:28.560 --> 08:32.200
You're crazy, Nanno.
That room is so scary.

08:32.280 --> 08:35.920
Rebellious students come out of there
completely tamed.

08:36.000 --> 08:38.280
No one wants to get put in that room.

08:43.200 --> 08:44.400
There she is.

08:55.520 --> 08:56.640
Are you Nanno?

08:56.720 --> 08:57.560
Yeah.

09:12.280 --> 09:13.880
Are you aware that we have

09:13.960 --> 09:16.280
very strict rules here?

09:18.400 --> 09:19.600
I'm aware.

09:19.680 --> 09:21.480
That's good to hear.

09:21.560 --> 09:24.720
Since you're new here,
I'll let you off easy once.

09:27.000 --> 09:31.000
You must memorize all 427 rules by heart.

09:34.800 --> 09:36.040
Thank you, ma'am.

09:36.120 --> 09:37.720
You'll do it elsewhere.

09:46.200 --> 09:47.560
THE RULES OF PANTANA WITTAYA SCHOOL

10:05.280 --> 10:06.600
-She's taunting them.
-Look at her.

10:06.680 --> 10:08.880
-Is she crazy?
-She's insane.

10:20.800 --> 10:23.840
The rules of Pantana Wittaya School…

10:24.520 --> 10:27.200
…established 1982.

10:31.080 --> 10:34.120
Do you think this is against the rules?

10:34.200 --> 10:37.120
There's no rule written in the book
against laughing at the rules.

10:41.520 --> 10:42.760
She's laughing.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.320
Rule number two.

10:48.720 --> 10:51.080
-Rule number three…
-We should call Teacher A.

11:17.000 --> 11:18.160
She's totally crazy.

11:31.680 --> 11:33.000
-She's burning the book.
-No.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.480
Damn.

11:43.800 --> 11:48.280
I read through the Book of Rules.
In all 427, none of them say

11:48.360 --> 11:51.960
that I can't set fire
to the book of rules.

11:54.600 --> 11:56.240
Take her to the Repentance Room.

11:56.920 --> 11:57.800
Yes.

12:02.040 --> 12:03.480
Oh, my.

12:04.880 --> 12:07.080
This is so ominous.

12:07.160 --> 12:09.880
Are you going to have me murdered?

12:22.720 --> 12:23.960
Mm.

12:29.960 --> 12:32.120
Hello, my lovely students.

12:32.760 --> 12:33.720
Behaving?

12:35.760 --> 12:36.880
Hello?

12:38.320 --> 12:41.640
Teacher, please get me out
of here. I promise I learned my lesson.

12:41.720 --> 12:44.720
Please, teacher. Please, let me go.

12:46.560 --> 12:49.160
We welcome those who do repent.

12:49.760 --> 12:51.680
Since you've made amends,

12:51.760 --> 12:54.400
we now consider you a valuable asset
to our school.

12:55.400 --> 12:59.920
So, you are free to rejoin
all your classes.

13:00.480 --> 13:02.120
Thank you for this chance, Teacher A.

13:03.240 --> 13:04.720
And you, New?

13:04.800 --> 13:06.440
Have you learned anything?

13:08.320 --> 13:09.480
I'm fine here.

13:09.560 --> 13:11.680
I didn't do anything wrong.

13:12.680 --> 13:15.480
But you filmed the teacher,
which is not good, New.

13:16.160 --> 13:18.800
It's Teacher B who didn't admit
her mistake.

13:18.880 --> 13:20.160
And she hurt Jelly.

13:21.160 --> 13:25.200
New, can you please just tell her
what she wants to hear?

13:25.280 --> 13:27.240
But this is not right.

13:27.320 --> 13:28.320
This has to stop.

13:29.120 --> 13:30.880
We can't keep living like this.

13:30.960 --> 13:33.520
If that's what you think,
then stay in there.

13:35.120 --> 13:36.480
Then, I'm quitting the school.

13:37.200 --> 13:38.160
You'll quit?

13:38.880 --> 13:41.320
Do you really think quitting
will solve everything?

13:43.600 --> 13:47.600
You know, there is an easy way to deal
with a student like you.

13:47.680 --> 13:51.080
We'll put your name on a list

13:51.160 --> 13:53.440
of undesirable people.

13:55.440 --> 14:01.120
That will ruin any chance you had
of getting

14:01.200 --> 14:03.320
into any university whatsoever.

14:04.800 --> 14:07.760
But, you have no right to do that.

14:07.840 --> 14:08.680
I do.

14:09.640 --> 14:11.280
And I have done it before.

14:12.760 --> 14:16.000
The world runs on nepotism.

14:16.080 --> 14:17.840
What about you?

14:17.920 --> 14:20.920
Are you prepared to face
the consequences of your choices?

14:21.880 --> 14:23.960
Just apologize to her…

14:24.040 --> 14:25.800
so we can get out of here.

14:26.520 --> 14:28.080
Tell me one more time.

14:28.160 --> 14:29.920
Do you still want to quit this school?

14:34.200 --> 14:35.360
No, I'm sorry.

14:37.680 --> 14:38.680
Say that again.

14:40.160 --> 14:42.480
I'm sorry. I was wrong.
You were right.

14:42.560 --> 14:45.360
I swear I won't hurt
the school's reputation ever again.

15:03.120 --> 15:04.560
Thank you.

15:10.160 --> 15:13.720
When New first arrived here,
he looked like you do right now.

15:15.400 --> 15:19.680
You may use this time
to repent for your choices.

15:19.760 --> 15:24.720
You must memorize
all the school rules by heart.

15:31.560 --> 15:36.360
The rules
for students of Pantana Wittaya School…

15:36.440 --> 15:40.160
…AD 1982.

15:42.080 --> 15:43.400
Rule number one,

15:44.280 --> 15:48.640
all students shall respect
and strictly follow

15:48.720 --> 15:50.560
the school rules.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.720
Rule number two,

15:53.800 --> 15:58.240
all students shall respect
and treat their teachers

15:58.320 --> 16:00.440
like their own family members

16:00.520 --> 16:04.120
and always be grateful
for their teachers' kindness.

16:31.680 --> 16:33.640
Teacher, there's a problem.

16:35.440 --> 16:38.560
Nanno, didn't you get in trouble
for yesterday?

16:40.360 --> 16:43.240
They just made me listen to all 427 rules

16:43.920 --> 16:45.800
over and over again in a dark room.

16:46.720 --> 16:47.920
Were you scared at all?

16:48.520 --> 16:51.080
Yah, Jelly's like a different person now.

16:53.880 --> 16:55.200
It's true.

16:56.360 --> 16:58.280
New's still too sick to come back.

17:00.200 --> 17:03.720
I didn't let her out of the room.
Why is she here now?

17:04.920 --> 17:08.800
To be completely honest,
I find this whole thing…

17:09.520 --> 17:10.920
pretty…

17:11.000 --> 17:12.960
boring and stupid.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.680
Are you a smoker, Teacher B?

17:25.640 --> 17:27.320
It really wasn't scary at all.

17:28.120 --> 17:29.680
If all of us break the rules,

17:30.640 --> 17:33.160
we can have a pretty big party
in there together.

17:37.400 --> 17:39.080
Okay.

17:41.040 --> 17:42.480
Stand up.

17:44.520 --> 17:48.240
Looks like I'll be partying
all by myself again.

18:09.520 --> 18:12.840
I've memorized all 427 rules.

18:12.920 --> 18:14.040
Rule one,

18:14.120 --> 18:17.360
all students should strictly follow
the school rules as written.

18:17.440 --> 18:18.520
Rule two,

18:18.600 --> 18:19.720
students should respect

18:19.800 --> 18:21.720
their teachers like they were family.

18:21.800 --> 18:22.720
Rule three…

18:22.800 --> 18:26.520
I'm going to ask you once,
who the hell are you?

18:26.600 --> 18:30.280
My name is Nanno. I'm the new girl.

18:30.360 --> 18:31.680
Have you forgotten?

18:34.800 --> 18:36.600
I'd also like to know

18:36.680 --> 18:38.600
how long you'll be able to endure this.

18:42.200 --> 18:45.200
Welcome to the Repentance Room, Nanno.

18:59.880 --> 19:02.960
The atmosphere is so pleasant in here.

20:12.240 --> 20:13.720
Who are you?

20:13.800 --> 20:16.960
I'm Nanno.
You keep asking me the same thing.

20:18.920 --> 20:20.320
Well, what do you want from us?

20:20.400 --> 20:23.160
Hm… that's different.

20:24.440 --> 20:26.280
Let's see, I want…

20:27.240 --> 20:30.360
I want you to tell your students
that you were wrong,

20:30.440 --> 20:32.960
admit that you were the one who planted

20:33.040 --> 20:34.240
the cigarettes.

20:34.320 --> 20:37.400
Admit the school is backwards,

20:37.480 --> 20:39.600
and then, I'll be satisfied.

20:40.960 --> 20:43.040
Such audacity from a young girl.

20:43.600 --> 20:44.960
Open your mouth.

20:51.320 --> 20:52.720
Want to defy me?

21:00.040 --> 21:02.160
Laugh if you understand.

21:02.840 --> 21:04.480
Don't get angry, Teacher A.

22:07.960 --> 22:10.160
Excuse me, ma'am.

22:18.480 --> 22:21.920
I'm Yuri.
It's my first day at this school.

22:22.760 --> 22:25.040
I'd like to be made
the head inspector please.

22:30.600 --> 22:33.200
Can a girl like you be inspector?

22:35.080 --> 22:38.080
The rules exist to serve the public.

22:38.720 --> 22:41.360
I want to be of service by enforcing them.

22:41.440 --> 22:43.640
I can give you my support.

22:44.440 --> 22:48.040
I know Nanno. She and I went
to the same school.

22:48.120 --> 22:49.960
I can help you deal with her.

23:00.680 --> 23:01.600
What is this?

23:02.160 --> 23:05.400
There is a rebel group of students
on a secret chat.

23:06.000 --> 23:08.120
So, I joined under a fake name.

23:09.040 --> 23:11.120
We can catch them before things get worse.

23:19.000 --> 23:21.200
-Come on.
-You, come to the front.

23:21.760 --> 23:23.720
Now, sit down.

23:23.800 --> 23:25.240
-Hands on your head.
-Hands up.

23:25.920 --> 23:28.720
Shit. How did they find out?

23:28.800 --> 23:30.240
There must be a mole here.

23:32.400 --> 23:36.040
Ah, yeah. Do we really have
to sit here all night?

23:36.120 --> 23:37.160
You, name?

23:37.720 --> 23:38.840
Sittichai.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.920
-What class?
-Class 6-5.

23:41.680 --> 23:43.520
-You?
-Teerapat.

23:43.600 --> 23:45.520
-Class?
-Class 4-2.

23:46.440 --> 23:47.840
Well, thank you, Yuri.

23:48.960 --> 23:50.880
You did an excellent job today.

23:52.800 --> 23:54.240
You can go rest now.

23:55.680 --> 23:57.960
Let me put that file away first.

24:33.160 --> 24:34.440
They're ready for you.

24:39.080 --> 24:41.080
Do you regret your actions?

24:41.160 --> 24:43.520
We are sorry, Principal.

24:43.600 --> 24:46.040
I asked whether you regret your actions.

24:46.560 --> 24:48.560
We regret them.
Sir, forgive us.

24:48.640 --> 24:49.640
Thank you.

24:50.560 --> 24:53.280
There's a place for those who do repent.

24:53.360 --> 24:56.320
No more mistakes, or…

24:56.400 --> 24:58.320
there will be punishment.

24:58.960 --> 25:03.000
Without question, you must follow
the rules here very strictly.

25:03.080 --> 25:06.560
Be strong and do not give in
to temptations.

25:07.560 --> 25:11.200
Very well. You may go to class.

25:53.240 --> 25:54.360
Hello, Yuri.

25:55.520 --> 25:58.080
Why do you keep dancing around
the issue, Nanno?

25:58.160 --> 26:00.360
Why are you still a two-faced bitch?

26:01.120 --> 26:03.560
I warn you, stay out of my way.

26:40.440 --> 26:41.920
Stop that, Nanno.

26:44.640 --> 26:46.520
What kind of trouble are you up to now?

26:48.080 --> 26:50.080
I want everyone in this school…

26:51.000 --> 26:55.240
to see what hypocrites you teachers are.

27:37.280 --> 27:39.160
Look into the camera, please.

27:41.720 --> 27:43.320
Stop that, Yuri.

27:43.400 --> 27:45.240
Come near me…

27:45.320 --> 27:47.840
and I'll send this clip to everyone.

27:48.480 --> 27:50.040
Then, what do you want from me?

27:51.600 --> 27:53.480
I want those documents.

27:57.240 --> 27:58.480
Hm?

28:05.400 --> 28:08.200
These papers show the total amount
of donations

28:08.280 --> 28:10.320
given to the school by the ministry.

28:11.120 --> 28:12.480
How interesting.

28:12.560 --> 28:16.320
Huh? Why does the school
look like trash then?

28:18.560 --> 28:21.040
It's never clean
and the lunch here is disgusting.

28:21.960 --> 28:23.920
We don't have computers either.

28:24.640 --> 28:27.200
So, where did the money go?

28:27.280 --> 28:29.840
Do not let Nanno's lies fool you.

28:29.920 --> 28:32.320
Those documents
are actually all fake, Yuri.

28:34.600 --> 28:38.200
If these papers are fake,
then it wouldn't matter…

28:38.280 --> 28:40.280
if we threw them away.

29:02.760 --> 29:03.840
Oops.

29:10.240 --> 29:11.480
Look, she's up there.

29:15.680 --> 29:16.520
You!

29:17.000 --> 29:18.800
She's over there.
Go get her.

29:18.880 --> 29:21.560
You should probably start
running away right now.

29:21.640 --> 29:23.520
Over there. Hurry!

29:23.600 --> 29:26.480
-Hurry up! Get her.
-Go get her.

29:26.560 --> 29:28.640
-Come on.
-Hurry.

29:28.720 --> 29:30.280
She went that way.

31:29.840 --> 31:31.120
I'm sorry, Nanno.

31:31.920 --> 31:35.840
But, to win at this game,
you must take one for the team.

32:00.080 --> 32:02.840
Hello teachers of Pantana Wittaya School .

32:02.920 --> 32:05.040
We hereby declare that…

32:05.120 --> 32:08.760
we will no longer submit
to the rules of this school.

32:13.720 --> 32:15.560
How dare you say that?

32:20.600 --> 32:21.920
What shall we do now?

32:22.920 --> 32:26.000
Well… should we torture them?

32:27.520 --> 32:30.440
Should we make them write down
their confessions in statement?

32:31.600 --> 32:34.200
Make them admit to all the horrible things
that they did to us.

32:34.800 --> 32:37.000
We will expose how evil they are
to everyone.

32:42.600 --> 32:43.440
Yeah.

32:43.520 --> 32:44.760
-Filthy animals.
-Yeah.

32:46.560 --> 32:47.880
You heard what she said.

32:47.960 --> 32:50.080
Write down your confession.

32:50.160 --> 32:51.520
Move it.

32:51.600 --> 32:53.720
-Let's go.
-Come on.

32:57.120 --> 32:58.440
Make them suffer.

32:58.520 --> 33:01.080
Let's give them a taste
of their own medicine.

33:01.160 --> 33:02.000
Hurry up!

33:03.360 --> 33:04.360
Come on.

33:05.920 --> 33:07.360
Write it!

33:25.560 --> 33:28.280
CONFESSION FORM YOU SHALL REPENT
AND BE PUNISHED FOR WHAT YOU DID

33:47.320 --> 33:48.720
Why can't you write it?

33:49.600 --> 33:52.160
Why can't you write it for us?
I'll help you.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.720
See, it's not that hard.

33:55.320 --> 33:57.760
Write that you hurt me.
Can't you write it?

33:57.840 --> 33:59.840
Can't you? Let me help you.

33:59.920 --> 34:01.040
Stop fighting back.

34:01.120 --> 34:03.040
Remember what you did, huh.

34:03.120 --> 34:04.800
Write what you did to me.

34:04.880 --> 34:07.480
Write, you left me without anything.

34:08.280 --> 34:09.920
Write that you made me lie.

34:10.600 --> 34:12.040
That you left me.

34:12.120 --> 34:13.920
Write down everything

34:14.000 --> 34:15.280
that you did to me.

34:15.360 --> 34:17.240
Do you have regrets?

34:17.320 --> 34:19.160
Write it down!

34:30.640 --> 34:32.880
-She's dead.
-What do we do now?

34:41.280 --> 34:42.360
Shit, New!

34:43.000 --> 34:45.200
You killed her with your chokehold.

34:47.480 --> 34:50.280
How can you all blame me?
You and you and you did this.

34:50.360 --> 34:52.320
We were just holding her down.

34:52.400 --> 34:54.800
-We didn't choke her to death.
-She's right, New.

34:55.480 --> 34:56.360
Honestly…

34:56.440 --> 34:58.280
I didn't even agree with this shit.

34:59.080 --> 35:01.560
I was afraid you'd think I was ignorant,

35:01.640 --> 35:03.320
and then turned on me instead.

35:03.880 --> 35:05.120
That's your fault.

35:05.200 --> 35:07.760
It's your fault. You killed her.

35:07.840 --> 35:09.840
-We should punish him.
-Yeah.

35:09.920 --> 35:11.480
You killed Teacher A.

35:13.320 --> 35:14.600
How could you do that?

35:14.680 --> 35:16.000
You all had a part in this.

35:16.080 --> 35:18.560
Shut up!

35:38.880 --> 35:41.240
Okay, I'll give you one last chance.

35:41.320 --> 35:46.400
If you stop, I will pardon your crimes

35:46.480 --> 35:47.880
including the murder.

36:03.200 --> 36:04.680
Hey, we can't give up yet.

36:05.360 --> 36:07.760
Isn't this the path we've all chosen?

36:10.560 --> 36:14.720
If we surrender, we will become
just like these teachers,

36:14.800 --> 36:15.800
you know.

36:30.160 --> 36:31.440
I think it's over now.

36:35.640 --> 36:38.840
Okay, capture the students
who've been bad.

36:48.760 --> 36:51.280
Everything has returned to normal.

36:51.360 --> 36:53.200
Very well, my dear students.

36:54.160 --> 36:59.280
You know we've been living in peace
and harmony for some time now.

36:59.360 --> 37:02.800
You've adhered to the rules for so long.

37:03.360 --> 37:04.600
Then, one day…

37:05.560 --> 37:09.400
a new student came along
to put ideas in your heads.

37:09.480 --> 37:12.400
She threw the whole school
into a state of chaos.

37:13.320 --> 37:14.840
Will we let

37:14.920 --> 37:17.680
the new student completely ruin us?

37:22.720 --> 37:25.520
Everyone, raise your hand
if you think we should kill her.

37:31.840 --> 37:35.280
Okay, very good choice.

37:50.000 --> 37:52.760
Since you have seen your errors,

37:54.320 --> 37:56.080
I'd like you…

37:56.160 --> 38:01.480
to take a step forward
and prove your loyalty to everyone

38:02.040 --> 38:05.120
by weeding out the radical insurgents

38:05.680 --> 38:09.040
who have disrupted
our peace and prosperity.

38:09.120 --> 38:11.840
Make sure they never cause us
trouble again.

38:21.440 --> 38:23.800
Use this knife to prove yourself,

38:24.920 --> 38:27.640
and that you are
a true and worthy student.

38:31.200 --> 38:35.000
You, I think yo should be
the first one to go.

38:35.680 --> 38:37.040
Here, take the knife.

38:37.880 --> 38:41.720
You wouldn't want to go to prison
for murder.

38:43.240 --> 38:44.560
Have you forgotten?

38:45.680 --> 38:47.640
It was Nanno who started all this.

38:47.720 --> 38:50.680
You're lying. Nanno fell to her death.

38:50.760 --> 38:52.280
How can you blame her for all this?

39:07.840 --> 39:09.400
It's time to get to work.

39:22.040 --> 39:24.880
Stop it. Everyone, stay calm.

39:34.320 --> 39:38.480
Hello, my dear teachers
and fellow students.

39:39.040 --> 39:41.720
I sure hope you did.

40:01.240 --> 40:03.120
Listen, stop.

40:09.480 --> 40:11.640
Let's go. Let's get out of here.
Let's go, come on.

40:15.080 --> 40:19.240
It looks like
you're outnumbered, Headmaster.

40:27.520 --> 40:28.600
Nanno.

40:30.320 --> 40:33.680
Have you forgotten that I have a gun here?

40:35.280 --> 40:36.640
I would like to know…

40:37.240 --> 40:41.520
if your gun has enough bullets
to kill each one of me.

40:54.400 --> 40:56.400
We also have weapons, Headmaster.

40:58.560 --> 41:02.480
Right now, we are live-streaming
from the Pantana Wittaya School gym

41:02.560 --> 41:05.240
and this is our headmaster.

41:23.800 --> 41:25.960
Oh, yes, it's me, the principal.

41:26.040 --> 41:29.560
Come on, put your phones away now.

41:29.640 --> 41:31.520
Listen, put your phones away.

41:31.600 --> 41:33.440
Put your phones away.

41:35.080 --> 41:36.960
Put them all away.

41:38.480 --> 41:40.040
Stop filming!

41:45.520 --> 41:46.680
Yes?

41:50.640 --> 41:51.880
Just shoot me.

42:01.760 --> 42:03.200
Shoot me!

42:11.800 --> 42:12.680
You bitch!

42:16.680 --> 42:20.240
Come on, say something to the camera.

42:20.320 --> 42:22.880
Nanno, do you think you've won?

42:23.400 --> 42:27.000
I've won? This is hardly a victory.

42:27.080 --> 42:28.760
This is just the start.

42:41.520 --> 42:43.760
Don't you see that your way doesn't work?

42:45.240 --> 42:47.200
Are you really going to keep me in here?

42:48.280 --> 42:51.160
I went to a lot of trouble
to get you that evidence.

42:52.440 --> 42:54.160
Yuri, you're just too impatient.

43:05.640 --> 43:09.120
You might have trouble breathing in here.

43:09.960 --> 43:13.080
That's right. I got locked in here alone
for the longest time.

43:13.160 --> 43:15.160
There's no phone reception.

43:16.280 --> 43:18.320
No food either.

43:19.840 --> 43:20.840
Wait, what? Who said that?

43:21.560 --> 43:24.680
There are so many of us here.

43:25.480 --> 43:27.080
Let's be cannibals.

43:28.120 --> 43:31.800
You're right. Who should we eat first?

43:32.600 --> 43:35.320
Should it be the black sheep?
What do you say? Wanna be eaten?

43:45.440 --> 43:46.920
Bye bye, everyone.

43:48.120 --> 43:49.680
See you later, Yuri.

43:49.760 --> 43:52.560
I'm sure you'll find a way
out of this place.

43:52.640 --> 43:53.840
Hang in there.

44:17.800 --> 44:19.920
Okay, what should we do next, Nanno?

44:23.960 --> 44:27.520
It's up to you to decide what to do next.

44:29.880 --> 44:32.840
Do you think we can fight
all those people out there.

45:52.560 --> 45:54.920
Who knows how the rest of the story goes.

45:55.680 --> 45:58.960
If things are black, white, or colored.

45:59.840 --> 46:04.040
Who is right? Who is wrong?
And who is better than their friend?

46:05.280 --> 46:07.120
Are we really the ones to judge…

46:08.240 --> 46:09.920
in this greyscale world?
